  <h2>Leggings Quality Is Decided Before Bulk Production</h2>
  <p>Performance leggings look simple, but the manufacturing requirements are strict. A successful legging must stay opaque, recover after stretch, hold the waist, feel comfortable and keep measurements stable after washing.</p>

  <p>Most leggings problems start when the buyer approves fabric only by hand feel or photo. Fitclo recommends approving leggings through fabric tests, fit tests and wash tests before bulk production.</p>

  <h2>Key Fabric Decisions for Leggings</h2>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Decision</th>
